@* Monitoring & Dashboard UI: the read side that turns signals from the other
   contexts into visibility and follow-up. Deliberately empty until the module
   has components of its own — an import here before there is anything to import
   would only be a guess at what it will need.

   When the first component does arrive, write every Backlog.* import as
   @using global::Backlog.Something. This project's root namespace is
   Backlog.Modules.Monitoring.UI, and the Razor generator emits these directives
   inside that namespace without a global:: prefix, so the leading "Backlog"
   binds to Backlog.Modules once a sibling puts a Backlog.Modules.Backlog
   namespace in scope. Nothing this project references does today, which is the
   only reason a bare import would still compile. *@
